      "output_preview": "## CLI Interface Phase \u2014 Complete\n\n### What was accomplished\n\n**`team-test/cli.py`** \u2014 Full-featured command-line interface for the Task Management tool:\n\n- **Argument parsing** via stdlib `argparse` (no third-party deps) with a clean subcommand structure\n- **Commands implemented**: `add`, `list` (alias `ls`), `show`, `update`, `done`, `cancel`, `start`, `delete` (alias `rm`), `search`, `stats`, `backup`\n- **Global `--file` / `-f` option** (also reads `$TASKS_FILE` env var) to specify the storage JSON path\n- **ANSI colour output** (auto-disabled when stdout is not a TTY or `NO_COLOR` is set): priority levels, status labels, overdue warnings, success/error messages\n- **Robust error handling**: `TaskNotFoundError`, `ValueError`, `ServiceError`, and unexpected exceptions all produce clean error messages on stderr with non-zero exit codes\n- **`--yes` / `-y` flag** on `delete` to skip the interactive confirmation prompt\n- **`--clear-due` flag** on `update` to clear a task's due date\n- **`main(argv)` entry point** that accepts an explicit argv list (enables clean testing without subprocess)\n\n**`team-test/test_cli.py`** \u2014 64 comprehensive tests covering:\n\n- `TestAdd` (11 tests): minimal, all fields, persistence, empty/whitespace title, invalid priority/status/due, tag parsing, short-id in output, multiple tasks\n- `TestList` (12 tests): empty, shows tasks, count, filter by status/priority/tag/overdue, sort by priority/title/desc, `ls` alias\n- `TestShow` (3 tests): found with all fields, not found\n- `TestUpdate` (10 tests): each field, clear-due, nothing-to-update guard, not found, invalid due date\n- `TestDone` / `TestCancel` / `TestStart` (2 tests each): happy path + not found\n- `TestDelete` (4 tests): `--yes` flag, `rm` alias, not found, removes correct task\n- `TestSearch` (5 tests): match, case-insensitive, no match, count, description search\n- `TestStats` (5 tests): empty, total, status breakdown, priority breakdown, overdue count\n- `TestBackup` (3 tests): success, custo",
